# Cache / sidecars / env PROTECT notes (never commit binaries; build may read locally):
#   portable/cache/**  — wheels, embeddable, cacert (see portable/ above)
#   wheels/            — offline heal pack beside repo
#   sidecars/da3/*.safetensors — FullKit seed only (see DA3 block below)
#   muravei_env/       — host/dev interpreter (see Python environment above)
# Purge at build = only portable/stage_* and *.locked_*; never the PROTECT list.

